{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022460/extras/Add_to_wishlist.png?t=1728929798\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022460/extras/Licia.gif?t=1728929798\" /><br><br>Nazizombies Slayer is a hardcore top-down pixel shooter. Complete guild tasks, buy equipment, kill your enemies, follow the development of the plot and enjoy the gameplay.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022460/extras/Story.png?t=1728929798\" /><br>The state of Zeichland declares war and starts fighting against the whole world. This is a terrible and uncomplicated situation for all mankind, but not for mercenaries, who see it only as an opportunity to earn money. The story is told on behalf of a mysterious mercenary from Big Earth, who arrived in Lower Zeich and settled in the newly opened branch of the Lanor Guild. You will have to fulfill the guild's tasks and follow the consequences of what is happening. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022460/extras/Core_mechanics.png?t=1728929798\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dynamic combat with ranged and melee weapons.<br></li><li> Explode mines and grenades to freeze enemies, inflict fire damage, poison ....<br></li><li> Combine grenades and mines for powerful new effects.<br></li><li> Customize your costumes to match a specific boss.<br></li><li> Upgrade your suits to move faster and absorb more damage.<br></li><li> Increase your capital. Trade items found in levels at the bar.<br></li><li> Find secrets in the levels and solve simple puzzles.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3022460?t=1728929798","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3022460?t=1728929798","capsule_im